Mesmer is an unofficial X-Plane plugin for Brunner CLS-E yokes. It is not
made, endorsed or supported by, or affiliated with, Brunner Elektronik AG or
Laminar Research. Brunner, CLS-E and CLS2Sim are names of Brunner Elektronik
AG; X-Plane is a trademark of Laminar Research. They are used here only to say
what the plugin works with.

The X-Plane SDK is not part of this repository or its releases' source. The
build downloads it from developer.x-plane.com, checks it against a pinned
SHA-256, and uses it under its own licence, which the SDK carries.
